<title>USA: Quickturn comfortable with rev estimates.</title>
<headline>Quickturn comfortable with rev estimates.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quickturn Design Systems Inc Tuesday said it is comfortable with analysts' revenue projections for the coming three quarters.</p>
<p>Chief Financial Officer Raymond Ostby, speaking to investors at the Hambrecht &amp; Quist Technology Conference, said he was comfortable with analysts revenue projections of $25 million, $30 million and $32 million, respectively, in the coming three quarters.</p>
<p>Quickturn reported revenues of $21.4 million in the first quarter ended in March.</p>
</text>
